Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,TapTab on Monad splits restaurant bills, so nobody fronts the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This £53.95 table is a clearly labelled local sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Diners claim whole items or selected shares of wine and starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Each pound total updates instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Only volunteers share the fair remainder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.91,0:00:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The table votes on the tip, then every diner approves the same split.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Any change clears consent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.53,0:00:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Payment opens only after approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Each diner funds exactly what they owe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,or sponsors somebody else without changing the underlying obligation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If £18.91 is still missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.85,0:00:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,settlement stays locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.07,0:01:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the full £53.95 arrives,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.48,0:01:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the venue can be paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stage Mode turns the same live table state
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.70,0:01:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,into a room-readable progress board.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The contract protects both outcomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Exact funding unlocks settlement.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.22,0:01:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Cancellation or expiry pays the venue nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.85,0:01:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and opens refunds to each original contributor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,including a sponsor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.54,0:01:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now switch from the £53.95 local sample
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,to live evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bill 2 represents £48.50 on Monad Testnet,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.80,0:01:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,with a confirmed creation transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Monad turns claims, approvals, sponsored payments and refunds
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,into shared state for the whole table,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,without a central bill keeper.
